# A unified diff's bytes are significant (empty context lines are a single
# space; hunks must match the target byte-for-byte), so .patch files must
# never be eol-normalized on commit/checkout — with core.autocrlf=true git
# would otherwise rewrite them and `git apply` of the parked
# experiments/earth-radiation/erp-runtime-chunk2.patch could fail on a fresh
# clone. Companion to the .patch excludes in .pre-commit-config.yaml.
*.patch -text
